   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1761231600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Layout only: no colors, sample data. Each block is a group: move it, resize it, duplicate it.\nLeft: the game screen at half scale (2560 × 1440, the owner's), to show where the window opens.\nRight: the window at real size, to show what it holds. Three options, one per row: keep one, mix them, or draw another.\nChecked on 2026-11-01: a window over the game in windowed fullscreen, which neither takes the focus\nnor lets a click through to the game (Linux, KDE). Exclusive fullscreen isn't supported, as in Exiled Exchange 2.",
   "originalText": "Layout only: no colors, sample data. Each block is a group: move it, resize it, duplicate it.\nLeft: the game screen at half scale (2560 × 1440, the owner's), to show where the window opens.\nRight: the window at real size, to show what it holds. Three options, one per row: keep one, mix them, or draw another.\nChecked on 2026-11-01: a window over the game in windowed fullscreen, which neither takes the focus\nnor lets a click through to the game (Linux, KDE). Exclusive fullscreen isn't supported, as in Exiled Exchange 2.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
