   "updated": 1761231600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A · opens 24 px from the cursor, on the side with room,\nnever over the game's item tooltip.\nHolds the essential: name, price, a few cheapest offers;\neverything else stays in the main window.\n+ small, the eye stays on the item.\n− no stats, no filters: the main window for those.",
