   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· How it closes: the mouse moving away from where Ctrl+D was pressed (Exiled Exchange 2: 40 px, unless Ctrl is held),\n  a click outside it, after a delay, or Ctrl+D again. Escape can't reach it: the game keeps the keyboard.\n· Ctrl+D on another item while it is open: replaces its content in place.\n· A click on it (a filter, an offer): checked to stay in the window without taking the game's focus (Linux).\n· With two screens, the main window already on the other one: show the window over the game anyway?\n· The note \"Play in windowed fullscreen\": a bubble at the first launch, or a Help section in the settings (mock-up).",
   "originalText": "· How it closes: the mouse moving away from where Ctrl+D was pressed (Exiled Exchange 2: 40 px, unless Ctrl is held),\n  a click outside it, after a delay, or Ctrl+D again. Escape can't reach it: the game keeps the keyboard.\n· Ctrl+D on another item while it is open: replaces its content in place.\n· A click on it (a filter, an offer): checked to stay in the window without taking the game's focus (Linux).\n· With two screens, the main window already on the other one: show the window over the game anyway?\n· The note \"Play in windowed fullscreen\": a bubble at the first launch, or a Help section in the settings (mock-up).",
